## Genome-scale metabolic modeling (GEMs)

The `model/` directory contains scripts and results related to genome-scale metabolic modeling and flux analysis:

- `ftINIT/`  
  Reconstruction of context-specific metabolic models using the ftINIT algorithm based on the Human1 template and transcriptomic data.
- `Kiwi/`  
  Visualization of reporter metabolites.
  
- `Riptide/`  
  Estimation of metabolic flux distributions using the RIPTiDe algorithm, including flux sampling results (1,000 samples per model) with further analysis code .


